<title>USA: TABLE- Sealright Co Inc Q2 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>TABLE- Sealright Co Inc Q2 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>DESOTO, Kan. 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.26   profit	 $0.15</p>
<p> Net profit		 2,915   profit	 1,625</p>
<p> Sales		     70,821		   71,471</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
